      ],
      "source": "https://petersburgil.org/petersburg-history"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Abraham Lincoln surveyed the town in 1835‑1836, and many New Salem residents moved to Petersburg in 1840.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
